# Convex agent skills, installed by `npx convex ai-files update`. Formatting them
# starts a tug-of-war: the CLI rewrites `agents/openai.yaml` with a wrapped
# `short_description`, Prettier collapses it back, and the next install dirties
# the tree again. Only the convex* dirs are vendored; our own skills stay formatted.
.agents/skills/convex*/
.claude/skills/convex*/
# Local backend state (`convex deployment create local`). Git already ignores it
# via .convex/.gitignore, but Prettier doesn't read that, so `pnpm format:check`
# fails for anyone developing against a local deployment.
.convex/
pnpm-lock.yaml
mockup/
public/
# Saved eval runs and reports (`pnpm eval`) — machine-written, gitignored.
.evals/
